# Footer layout (site-1 / VRGO)

## Social icons

- Do **not** put Facebook or Pinterest icons (or links) in the footer.
- LinkedIn may remain as the only social icon.
- Do not re-add FB/Pinterest “for completeness” or marketing parity.

## Oldalak + Jogi columns

- The footer link block (**Oldalak** and **Jogi szekció**) must **always** sit in **at least two side-by-side columns** (e.g. `grid grid-cols-2`), including on narrow viewports.
- Goal: keep this section short in height; do not stack Oldalak above Jogi in a single column.
- Do not collapse them to one column at any breakpoint.
